WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.954
Meet Read Assist. Your library for documents,
pictures, and web articles.

2
00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:12.628
Swipe right to left to turn forward. Switch
between PDF and text.

3
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:19.454
Swipe up for reading controls. Adjust the
brightness and add a warm tint to suit your
reading.

4
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:26.556
Choose your voice, reading speed, and accuracy
settings.

5
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:34.185
Look up English words as you go. Download the
dictionary pack once to use definitions offline.

6
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:40.805
Choose a style you like: Warm Library, Modern
Focus, or Night Reader.

7
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:47.735
Night Reader brings a darker look to your
library. Change themes whenever you like.

8
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:56.685
Start narration, then switch apps. Reading
continues in the background, with playback
controls close by.

9
00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:00.150
Each sentence adds something new to the picture.

10
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:04.100
Listen to the words, or let your eyes move
gently across the page.

11
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:11.060
When you are ready for a break, pause from
Android media controls.
